{
  "description": "Donut shop website with online ordering",
  "about": "A website in three languages (Armenian, Russian, English) for a chain of donut and coffee shops. Visitors browse the menu with prices from the database, open any item for its details, design a donut in 3D, fill a gift box by dragging donuts into it, and order for pickup or delivery with a chosen day and time; payment is cash or card when the order is handed over. There are also shop pages with a map, an events request form, phone numbers from any country and a cookie consent banner that only loads statistics after the visitor agrees. Staff use an admin panel to manage orders and their status, the menu and prices, shops, delivery zones, site texts, reviews and staff accounts, and new orders are sent to Telegram or email.",
  "stack": [
    "Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, TypeScript",
    "Tailwind CSS 4, Radix UI",
    "next-intl (3 languages)",
    "Drizzle ORM, PostgreSQL (Neon; PGlite for the local demo)",
    "React Hook Form, Zod, libphonenumber-js",
    "Three.js (3D donut designer)",
    "Vercel hosting, Vercel Blob for uploaded photos",
    "Telegram bot and email notifications",
    "Vitest and Playwright tests"
  ],
